    "updated_at": "2016-12-29T04:40:35Z",
    "body": "WebKit was doing this to match IE. Since Edge no longer behaves this way and since no longer throwing should be fairly safe compatibility wise, I think it would be OK to align WebKit with the specification. Of course , this is provided that Blink devs agree to do the same.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
